WEBVTT

00:05:58.416 --> 00:06:01.850
channel the love sustained
in Marvin's upper register

00:06:01.874 --> 00:06:03.460
under his skullcap.

00:06:03.484 --> 00:06:05.527
Black music at its best

00:06:05.551 --> 00:06:07.477
is an exploded black hole

00:06:07.501 --> 00:06:11.070
responding to the call
of America at its worst.

00:06:11.094 --> 00:06:13.872
Strike us down, the music lives,

00:06:13.896 --> 00:06:16.576
dark, like tar or tobacco

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.779
or cotton in muddy water.

00:06:18.803 --> 00:06:21.601
Get home to me, son.

00:06:21.625 --> 00:06:25.129
Like a love supreme, a god as love,

00:06:25.153 --> 00:06:27.153
a love overrules,

00:06:27.177 --> 00:06:30.296
feathers for the angelic lift
of the restless dead,